---
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
import BobTheSeagull from '../components/BobTheSeagull.astro';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Caravan Park Tycoon | Fin & Games</title><meta name="description" content="Caravan Park Tycoon is a cosy British holiday-park management game from Fin & Games."><style>
:root{--bg:#081018;--surface:#101c26;--border:rgba(255,255,255,.09);--accent:#fbbf24;--sea:#38bdf8;--text:#f8fafc;--muted:#a8b6c4}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.7 system-ui,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:1.5rem}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:1.5rem}nav{display:flex;gap:1.2rem}nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}.hero{padding:6rem 0 4rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font:500 .78rem monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:.8rem 0 1.5rem}.lead{font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:720px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1rem}.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:1.5rem}.card h2{margin-top:0}.card p{color:var(--muted)}.wide{margin-top:1rem}.back{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}footer{margin-top:5rem;padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:700px){header{align-items:flex-start;gap:1rem;flex-direction:column}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap"><header><a href="/"><Logo size={42}/></a><nav><a href="/games">Game</a><a href="/devlogs">Devlog</a><a href="/npc-builder">NPC Builder</a><a href="/support">Support</a><a href="/about">About</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">Fin & Games · In development</div><h1>Caravan Park Tycoon</h1><p class="lead">A cosy management game with a distinctly British flavour. Start with an overgrown plot of land and turn it into the holiday park people actually want to visit.</p></section><section class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>🌳 Start with a mess</h2><p>Clear trees and overgrown land, make use of what you remove, and slowly turn an empty plot into your park.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>🚐 Build the park</h2><p>Create pitches for tents, caravans and future custom vehicles. Add facilities, utilities, food and entertainment.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>🌿 Beauty matters</h2><p>Your park needs to look good as well as make money. Too many vans can hurt beauty, but too few pitches can hurt income.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>🧍 Meet the residents</h2><p>Guests and NPCs should feel like people, not numbers. Supporters may eventually be able to create characters who join the park.</p></article></section><article class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">A few things we're planning</div><h2>Custom parks, custom characters and secrets.</h2><p>Custom tents and caravans are part of the longer-term vision. There will also be odd little discoveries and Easter eggs. Some ideas are still deliberately undecided while the game takes shape.</p><p><strong>And then there is Bob the Mighty.</strong> King of the Seagulls. Find him. Treat him well. He may help you. Chase him away often enough and he may decide the gulls have a problem with you.</p></article></main><footer><a class="back" href="/">← Back to Fin & Games</a></footer></div><BobTheSeagull/></body></html>